<Base title="Our story">
  <section class="wrap prose">
    <p class="kicker">Dhaga Studio</p>
    <h1 class="title">Our story</h1>
    <p>Dhaga Studio began in 2019 with two looms in a lane near Johari Bazaar in Jaipur. Friends kept asking us to post scarves to relatives in other cities, so we did, wrapped in muslin with a handwritten note.</p>
    <p>Today we work directly with weaving clusters in Bagru, Kutch, Pochampally and Srinagar, and keep a short list: everyday cotton, festival silks and warm winter wraps. Every page tells you where the piece was made.</p>
    <p>Orders are packed by hand within a day. If something arrives damaged, send us a photo and we'll replace it.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
